# Build context of deploy/site/Dockerfile (the repository root): build output and VCS data the site build never reads.
# The private paths of scripts/publish-github.sh are deliberately not listed (a copy of that list would drift): they stay in the
# build stage, which is never pushed; only /out reaches the image, and build_site.py refuses a link or an include into them.
.git
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
site/_build
